---
import bird from "../assets/sisu_bird.png";
import sun from "../assets/inclusivity_sun.png";
import tree from "../assets/responsibility_tree.png";

import "../styles/tokens.css";
---

<style>
  .values {
    width: 800px;
    height: 650px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .value-card {
    display: flex;
    border-width: 6px;
    border-style: solid;
    border-radius: 42px;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .value-card--text {
    padding: 10px;
  }

  .value-card img {
    display: block;
    width: 180px;
  }

  .values {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);

    /* Define 3 equal-height rows */
    grid-template-rows: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .sisu {
    border-color: #c470e0;
  }

  .inclusivity {
    border-color: #fcc27b;
  }

  .responsibility {
    border-color: #0db89e;
  }
</style>

<div class="values">
  <div class="sisu value-card">
    <img src={bird.src} alt="" />
  </div>
  <div class="inclusivity value-card">
    <img src={sun.src} alt="" />
  </div>
  <div class="responsibility value-card">
    <img src={tree.src} alt="" />
  </div>
  <div class="sisu value-card value-card--text">
    <p>
      <strong>Sisu</strong> is a Finnish concept, encompassing the qualities of perseverance
      and determination. Reflective of SISU, our swallow is a representation of an
      extraordinarily agile bird that embodies grit, resilience and strength qualities
      Kiva aims to foster in all its stakeholders.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="inclusivity value-card value-card--text">
    <p>
      Much like the sun, and how it shines over everyone without prejudice,
      <strong>Inclusivity</strong> is at Kiva's core. Fostering a welcoming and equitable
      space where everyone's differences are celebrated through a community rooted
      in kindness, making parts of a whole.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="responsibility value-card value-card--text">
    <p>
      Learning to care for the environment and forming a deep connection with
      nature is considered paramount at Kiva. Respecting the life around us,
      understanding that we don't exist in a vacuum and that all Life is
      interconnected, is the key to cultivating empathy and <strong>
        Social Responsibility</strong
      > in all our interactions.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
